WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:06.710
My name is Emily DePangher and I graduated
in 2013 from Paideia Christian School. I was

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:12.870
homeschooled and grew up in Los Gatos California,
and I'm now a Politics major at Hillsdale

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:18.220
College. I'm spending this semester in Washington
DC as a part of the Washington Hillsdale Internship

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:23.080
Program. I'm interning with Congressman Tom
McClintock on Capital Hill.The Washington

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.109
Hillsdale Internship Program, we
call it WHIP for short, we bring anywhere

00:00:27.109 --> 00:00:31.830
between ten to twenty students a semester
out to DC. They take two or three classes

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:36.340
and they intern on the hill, at the Heritage
Foundation, really anywhere they want to.

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.050
When we find somebody coming out of college
who has some practical real world experience,

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:47.329
especially experience that applies to what
we do, it really sets them apart. Washington

00:00:47.329 --> 00:00:52.329
is one of those places that kids can learn
a lot and gain a lot just from being hear

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:57.379
a few moths. And in that since, coming here
and having that interning experience I guarantee

00:00:57.379 --> 00:00:59.210
will be life changing.

